{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Fructose</strong>\u00a0is a high-speed, semi-open roguelite FPS set in sprawling, procedurally generated battlefields. Every run drops you into a fresh, layered playground built for wall-running, dashing, double-jumping, and total movement freedom. Explore, improvise, and unleash chaos with your evolving arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as one of four superpowered animal ninjas \u2014 Fox, Elephant, Wolverine, or Monkey \u2014 waging an all-out war against a fruit-infested world twisted by demonic corruption. Slice, smash, and blast your way through waves of cursed produce in your fight to cleanse the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506550/extras/d7dc865f5839135f91191a1f1a552a11.avif?t=1758318332\" width=638 height=298 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\ud83c\udf49 <strong>Imagine Demonic Fruit Ninja meets Ghostrunner with Guns</strong> <br> <br><strong>One Manual Weapon, Autofire Everything Else</strong><br>Wield a melee weapon you aim yourself, while all your ranged weapons auto-fire to shred enemies around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural Arenas</strong><br>Fight through semi-open orchards warped by dark magic \u2014 new layouts every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Possessed Fruit Enemies</strong><br>Battle evolving monstrosities like Banana Snakes, Cherry Cannons, and Dragonfruit Dragons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Juiced Arsenal</strong><br>Slice with swords or blast with wands, rifles, and even panda cannons. Mix melee and ranged loadouts for wild combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast, Fluid Action</strong><br>Dash, bend time, and survive intense 30-minute runs filled with precision chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Between-Wave Upgrades</strong> <br>Gather coins to buy weapons, perks, and game-changing gear mid-run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Persistent Power-Ups</strong> <br>Collect seeds to grow stronger every run \u2014 unlock permanent upgrades and discover new dark recipes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2506550?t=1758318332","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506550/3d6b4912687521c7ad299b0036e018ca4ea7395c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758318332","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506550/7516f19a1d18465aeb26631c9dcf21ed4bff34fd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758318332","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506550/7516f19a1d18465aeb26631c9dcf21ed4bff34fd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758318332","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2888260,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Fructose</strong>\u00a0is a high-speed, semi-open roguelite FPS set in sprawling, procedurally generated battlefields. Every run drops you into a fresh, layered playground built for wall-running, dashing, double-jumping, and total movement freedom. Explore, improvise, and unleash chaos with your evolving arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as one of four superpowered animal ninjas \u2014 Fox, Elephant, Wolverine, or Monkey \u2014 waging an all-out war against a fruit-infested world twisted by demonic corruption. Slice, smash, and blast your way through waves of cursed produce in your fight to cleanse the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span cla